      "Abstract": {
        "CopyrightInformation": "Copyright © 2017 Elsevier Ltd. All rights reserved.",
        "AbstractText": "The indolyl-naphthyl maleimide 7 is a potent inhibitor of the classical PKC isotypes α,β and shows excellent selectivity over the novel PKC isotypes δ,ε,η,θ and other kinases belonging to the AGC family. The SAR around 7 as well as the physico-chemical characteristics of selected derivatives and their activity in T and B cell activation and proliferation assays are discussed."
      },
